<title>ARGENTINA: Argentina's Suquia bank Q1 net $2.6 mln.</title>
<headline>Argentina's Suquia bank Q1 net $2.6 mln.</headline>
<dateline>BUENOS AIRES 1996-11-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Period ended Sept 30.</p>
<p>Shr $0.044 vs $0.025</p>
<p>Net $2.6 million vs $1.3 million</p>
<p>Net financial revenue $18.1 million vs $16.5 million</p>
<p>Note: Bank deposits at Suquia rose to $624 million, up 35 percent from $461 million in the same quarter a year earlier. Full name is Banco del Suquia.</p>
<p>-- Buenos Aires Newsroom, 541 3180668</p>
</text>
